window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/comm-v28-131-51d52c9587db15ed.json"]={sha256:"51d52c9587db15ed41a051594f6ffdcd3542d193fdbdd4cf3a036042f6c3ae1a",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v28-case-c654a2fdd8a46a25","url":"https://deepspace.jpl.nasa.gov/dsndocs/810-005/","title":"DSN Telecommunications Link Design Handbook 810-005","titleEn":"DSN Telecommunications Link Design Handbook 810-005","publisher":"NASA / JPL","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"comm-v28-131","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"comm-v28-131","related":[{"id":"comm-v28-132","referenceUrls":["https://science.nasa.gov/learn/basics-of-space-flight/chapter10-1/"],"title":"Voyager 式極低率遙測：發射能量與資料價值","titleEn":"Voyager-style low-rate telemetry: transmit energy and data value","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：交付物能重現 30 dB Eb/N0 與 20 dB Eb/N0，保留失敗情境且每個通過判定有明確門檻；需分開列出模型未涵蓋的實際系統驗證。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: The artifacts must reproduce 30 dB Eb/N0 and 20 dB Eb/N0, preserve failing scenarios and attach a threshold to each pass decision; list actual-system validation outside this model separately.","difference":"能推導並解釋0.125 J/information bit transmitted與0.5 J/information bit transmitted，建立voyager_energy.csv、接觸資料量與能量守恆、失敗封包另算表，並完成以下驗收：本題若單次需60000資訊bit，第一率足夠、第二率不足；低率的接收優勢不能補足固定接觸資料量。","differenceEn":"Derive and explain 0.125 J/information bit transmitted and 0.5 J/information bit transmitted; create voyager_energy.csv, contact-volume and energy balances, and a separate failed-packet ledger; apply this acceptance decision: A60000-bit contact requirement is met only by the first rate; a lower-rate reception advantage cannot replace missing contact volume.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["從原理 Eb/N0(dB)=C/N0(dB-Hz)-10log10(Rb)；固定接收功率時降資料率可提高每位元能量，尚須扣實作損失。 展開基準式 60-10*log10(1000)；逐步記錄中間量與單位，先手算再用計算器或Python重算。接著用不同表示法交叉檢查：在線性域以10^6 Hz除以1000或10000 bit/s得1000與100，再轉dB；分清資訊率與編碼位元率。 將兩條推導一起存入 dsn_energy.csv、dB與線性對照、率定義與鏈路餘裕表。","從原理 固定射頻輸出P時，每送出資訊位元的射頻能量為P/R；這不是接收Eb，也不含放大器效率或太空器全系統能量。 展開基準式 20/160；逐步記錄中間量與單位，先手算再用計算器或Python重算。接著用不同表示法交叉檢查：用接觸總能量20000 J除以160000或40000資訊bit，得到同值；再把任何失敗封包從交付bit扣掉另算。 將兩條推導一起存入 voyager_energy.csv、接觸資料量與能量守恆、失敗封包另算表。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Starting from Eb/N0 in dB equals C/N0 in dB-Hz minus10log10(Rb); lower rate raises energy per bit at fixed received power, before implementation losses., expand baseline expression 60-10*log10(1000); record intermediate values and units, calculate manually, then repeat with a calculator or Python. Use this independent representation: In linear units divide10^6 Hz by1000 or10000 bit/s to obtain1000 and100, then convert to dB; distinguish information and coded rates. Save both derivations with dsn_energy.csv, linear/dB cross-checks, rate definitions and a link-margin table.","Starting from At fixed RF output P, transmit RF energy per information bit is P/R; this is neither received Eb nor total spacecraft energy and excludes amplifier efficiency., expand baseline expression 20/160; record intermediate values and units, calculate manually, then repeat with a calculator or Python. Use this independent representation: Divide total contact energy20000 J by160000 or40000 information bits; then separately recompute delivered-bit cost after excluding failed packets. Save both derivations with voyager_energy.csv, contact-volume and energy balances, and a separate failed-packet ledger.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"comm-v28-141","referenceUrls":["https://www.itu.int/ITU-T/recommendations/rec.aspx?lang=en&rec=16060"],"title":"G.652 單模光纖：端到端損耗預算","titleEn":"G.652 single-mode fiber: end-to-end loss budget","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：交付物能重現 30 dB Eb/N0 與 20 dB Eb/N0，保留失敗情境且每個通過判定有明確門檻；需分開列出模型未涵蓋的實際系統驗證。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: The artifacts must reproduce 30 dB Eb/N0 and 20 dB Eb/N0, preserve failing scenarios and attach a threshold to each pass decision; list actual-system validation outside this model separately.","difference":"完成兩組條件的可重算判定，指出哪些觀察能區分原因。 教學可用損耗上限14 dB；名義通過、變更不通過。記錄剩餘裕度，但不宣稱已量測真實鏈路。","differenceEn":"Produce reproducible decisions for both configurations and identify observations that discriminate causes. Teaching allowance is14 dB: nominal passes and changed fails. Report remaining margin without claiming a measured installed link.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["從原理 Eb/N0(dB)=C/N0(dB-Hz)-10log10(Rb)；固定接收功率時降資料率可提高每位元能量，尚須扣實作損失。 展開基準式 60-10*log10(1000)；逐步記錄中間量與單位，先手算再用計算器或Python重算。接著用不同表示法交叉檢查：在線性域以10^6 Hz除以1000或10000 bit/s得1000與100，再轉dB；分清資訊率與編碼位元率。 將兩條推導一起存入 dsn_energy.csv、dB與線性對照、率定義與鏈路餘裕表。","合成路由長40 km、8個熔接各0.1 dB、2接頭各0.5 dB、預留3 dB；纖損由0.20改為0.25 dB/km。 名義式 40*0.2+8*0.1+2*0.5+3 = 12.8 dB；變更式 40*0.25+8*0.1+2*0.5+3 = 14.8 dB。逐項標示量綱，先代入未四捨五入數值再作比較。 手算名義式並保存所有中間項，實作下列獨立驗證而非只抄最終數字： 先加總元件，再把各項轉成線性傳輸率相乘，取負10log10回查；不得重複加入設計裕度。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Starting from Eb/N0 in dB equals C/N0 in dB-Hz minus10log10(Rb); lower rate raises energy per bit at fixed received power, before implementation losses., expand baseline expression 60-10*log10(1000); record intermediate values and units, calculate manually, then repeat with a calculator or Python. Use this independent representation: In linear units divide10^6 Hz by1000 or10000 bit/s to obtain1000 and100, then convert to dB; distinguish information and coded rates. Save both derivations with dsn_energy.csv, linear/dB cross-checks, rate definitions and a link-margin table.","Synthetic route:40 km, eight 0.1 dB splices, two 0.5 dB connectors and 3 dB reserve; change fiber attenuation from0.20 to0.25 dB/km. Nominal 40*0.2+8*0.1+2*0.5+3 = 12.8 dB; changed 40*0.25+8*0.1+2*0.5+3 = 14.8 dB. Label dimensions, substitute unrounded values and only then compare. Calculate the nominal expression with intermediate terms and implement this independent validation rather than copying the final number: Sum components, then multiply their linear transmissions and convert back with minus10log10; apply reserve only once.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v28-case-76cde582675d7b6c","url":"https://science.nasa.gov/learn/basics-of-space-flight/chapter10-1/","title":"Basics of Space Flight: Telecom","titleEn":"Basics of Space Flight: Telecom","publisher":"NASA","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v28-case-2e04d0cf568e8b45","url":"https://www.itu.int/ITU-T/recommendations/rec.aspx?lang=en&rec=16060","title":"ITU-T G.652: Characteristics of a single-mode optical fibre and cable","titleEn":"ITU-T G.652: Characteristics of a single-mode optical fibre and cable","publisher":"ITU-T","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
